{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261112/photo/bkn-20261112080754938-1112_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261112094743\"/><p>秀茂坪發生傷人案。今日(12日)早上7時27分，一名南亞裔女子途經曉光街42號一行人天橋升降機對開時遭3名男子用木棍襲擊，有途人見狀代為報案。救護車接報到場將清醒頭部及身體多處受傷女子送院治理，兇徒得逞後登上一輛私家車逃去，人員在附近一帶兜截，暫未發現涉案人士及相關車輛。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T02:07:18.054231+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T00:07:54+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T03:08:07.873267+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T02:00:51.573815+00:00","content_hash":"aea3ef66422737b40d5dbdaf37eb803e130ebaae0f5580db8660f0a2c0bc73ba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}